abstract: >
  Reproducible Python simulations for a wavelength-multiplexed optical memory voxel
  concept: linear refractive-index superposition model, 4x4 readout matrix inversion,
  MZI phase/level analysis, noise/calibration sensitivity, SNR budget estimates,
  thermal/optical crosstalk models, and energy/CO2 scenario analysis. Intended to
  support open, dated defensive publication and further research.
